                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "fb977f85-2bc2-3462-a652-823d2da7b92e",
                        "entry_id": "67d70104-a915-3326-a274-9261c33cd34b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "alkali"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "inanimate"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e339d4b1-1962-42c5-8938-c0b9ab8e1c9f",
                                "sense_id": "fb977f85-2bc2-3462-a652-823d2da7b92e",
                                "text": "— Благодарю вас. — Он остановился, взял сигару и нервно откусил её кончик. — Это помогает думать, — сказал он. — Это мир, микрокосм. На одном конце щёлочи, на другом — кислоты… Таково равновесие и мира, в котором нейтрализуются противоположные начала. Прощайте, доктор!",
                                "translation": "\"Thank you.\" He stopped, took the cigar and nervously bit off the end. \"This helps one to think,\" said he. \"This world is a microcosm. On one end is alkali, and on the other acids. . . . The same equilibrium has the world, in which the opposing ends become neutralized. Farewell, doctor!\"",
                                "english": "\"Thank you.\" He stopped, took the cigar and nervously bit off the end. \"This helps one to think,\" said he. \"This world is a microcosm. On one end is alkali, and on the other acids. . . . The same equilibrium has the world, in which the opposing ends become neutralized. Farewell, doctor!\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
